agraph\"> <strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Immerse yourself in a world where the environment tells its own story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Optional Dialogues</strong>: Engage in dialogues only if you choose\u2014perfect for players who prefer action over conversation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Minimal UI</strong>: Enjoy a clean, immersive experience with minimal UI and no distracting indicators. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local Co-op</strong>: Play with friends in local cooperative mode.<br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/GloomveilNewGif01.gif?t=1745259803\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/GloomveilTitleFinal2.png?t=1745259803\" /></p>","developers":["Ricotoni Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/5245789e7626a8a44ca63875a36c10b6ad24be43/header.jpg?t=1745259803","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116979,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116979/movie480.mp4?t=1742517600","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116979/movie_max.mp4?t=1742517600"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116979/15f94bf58763dbe10b513347333b856f0d2e6b00/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742517600","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116979/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742517600","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116979/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=174